WEBVTT

00:06:57.163 --> 00:07:02.710
you feel safe to spend all this time
and all this love on it.

00:07:03.919 --> 00:07:05.796
Look at this amazing world.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:09.550
It started as a small family project,

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:11.760
and now, ten years later,

00:07:11.802 --> 00:07:14.388
the family still plays
together in this world.

00:07:14.763 --> 00:07:19.059
I think this is a great example
of why you should be able to trust

00:07:19.101 --> 00:07:23.230
that your metaverse will be around
and work very well for a lifetime.

00:07:23.898 --> 00:07:27.234
It would be devastating for this family
if they lost this project

00:07:27.276 --> 00:07:28.652
they have together

00:07:28.694 --> 00:07:32.031
and all the dreams
they still hope to fulfill